<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Bottling Q1 profit higher.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Bottling Q1 profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter result to end-March 1997 for Nigerian Bottling Company, local bottler of Coca-cola. (In million naira)</p>
<p>					 1997	  1996</p>
<p> Turnover			   4,600	 4,200</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	 467.9	 401.5</p>
<p> Taxation			   140.3	 120.4</p>
<p> Profit after taxation	  327.5	   281</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
